aotic special cards. Each match is set around a casual card table full of colorful characters\u2014and in Capote, no win is guaranteed, and any card can flip the game.\n\nPlayers bet how many tricks they think they\u2019ll win, then play their cards round by round to hit that number exactly. If you win more or fewer tricks than you bet, you\u2019ll take a virtual shot for each one off. Hit four shots and\u2026 you\u2019re out. Capotado!\n\nIf the cards aren\u2019t in your favor, don\u2019t worry\u2014messing with your friends is also a valid strategy. Play your special cards at the right time to twist the odds, sabotage their bets, or turn a sure win into chaos.", "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/capote", "videos": [{"id": 165320, "name": "Announcement Trailer", "video_id": "r0YcLndFzIw", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=r0YcLndFzIw", "title": "Capote: Trailer de Acesso Antecipado", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/r0YcLndFzIw/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 165321, "name": "Announcement Trailer", "video_id": "FluH-SdHqf8", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=FluH-SdHqf8", "title": "Capote | Announcement Trailer (2025)", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/FluH-SdHqf8/maxresdefault.jpg"}]}